   "stem_html": "James  K. Polk’s defeat of Henry Clay in the 1844 presidential election led to ",
   "answers": [
    {
     "id": 1169604,
     "content_html": "loss of U.S. territorial interests in Oregon "
    },
    {
     "id": 1169603,
     "content_html": "decreasing public support for westward expansion"
    },
    {
     "id": 1169602,
     "content_html": "a period of comparative calm in U.S. foreign policy"
    },
    {
     "id": 1169605,
     "content_html": "a greater likelihood that Texas would be annexed"
    }
